<http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/ActiveImplant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/ImplantableDevice> .
