_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onClass> <http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/Incident> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#minQualifiedCardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/addressesIncident> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
