<http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/RiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The category of a risk, such as malfunction risk, injury risk, infection risk or diagnostic risk"@en .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/RiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Type"@en .
