<http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A safety communication issued by a manufacturer to healthcare professionals warning about risks associated with a device."@en .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Safety Alert"@en .
